            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I didn't understand what to change. Try for example: “half a minute”, “no slow motion”, “find the dog”."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "לא הבנתי מה לשנות. נסו למשל: “חצי דקה”, “בלי הילוך איטי”, “תמצא את הכלב”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
